      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2011 American Society for Reproductive Medicine. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "The objective of this study was to evaluate the degree of symptomatic relief obtained after treatment with magnetic resonance-guided focused ultrasound surgery in patients with adenomyosis. Quality of life and pain assessment questionnaires from 35 women, collected on the day of treatment and up to 6 months after treatment, indicated that the treatment was safe and there was a significant reduction in symptoms."
      },
